1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,550
The trial run began in April and ran, with interruptions, until December.

2
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:21,586
Across February and June, the team was simply too small; in July and September the enrolment in the preparatory course was enough, and in October and November it was necessary to postpone the demonstration.

3
00:00:21,586 --> 00:00:25,530
“Maybe in May,” the local minister said.

4
00:00:25,530 --> 00:00:39,408
“Perhaps next year.” Nevertheless, the work went on alongside the cycling club and the roadside BBQ, which was more popular than any of their workshops.

5
00:00:39,408 --> 00:00:48,901
The case was a geographic one: a faulty road, a damp crossing, and a hint of corruption in the luggage service.

6
00:00:48,901 --> 00:01:10,716
“I can predict a delay,” Aisha said, “but I cannot prescribe a remedy without the local people.” A Marxist essay, a poem about a spaceship, and a geometric diagram of the intersection were all submitted as evidence, and all of them were criticized in the same week.

7
00:01:10,716 --> 00:01:24,308
The instant the trial began, a quarrelsome driver was arrested for trafficking a spare tyre; the contextual part of the story was that his brother had lost the family job the year before.

8
00:01:24,308 --> 00:01:33,802
“We must pursue the system, not the man,” the team wrote, “and we must retell the case without the fear.”

9
00:01:33,802 --> 00:01:42,255
The indispensable part was the spontaneity of the queue: people simply stepped forward when the timetable failed.

10
00:01:42,255 --> 00:01:54,993
“It is not exploration,” Maya said, “it is improvisation.” They wrote it down, and the essay that came out of it was better than the report.

11
00:01:54,993 --> 00:02:03,636
What the team could not demonstrate was the one thing the council wanted: that a small change would survive a large system.

12
00:02:03,636 --> 00:02:08,585
“Maybe it will, perhaps it will not,” Lin wrote.

13
00:02:08,585 --> 00:02:18,643
“We can only see it through.” That sentence went into the report, across the whole width of the page, in their own hand.

14
00:02:18,643 --> 00:02:29,081
The local minister had said the team could expect nothing, and the team, despite everything, still had to allow for the service to fail.

15
00:02:29,081 --> 00:02:37,424
A car, a door, an area, a street, and a road: the small words of the report did most of the work.

16
00:02:37,424 --> 00:02:48,956
“If a problem arises far from the depot, we will run through it together,” Aisha said, “and that is a job nobody else wants.”
